<title>CROATIA: Head of Croatian bank rehab agency dies - Hina.</title>
<headline>Head of Croatian bank rehab agency dies - Hina.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Head of the Croatian bank rehabilitation agency, Vladimir Kopf, died overnight from injuries sustained in a car crash last week, Hina news agency said.</p>
<p>It was not clear who would replace Kopf, aged 38, at the helm of the government body which has so far overhauled three troubled banks and which also guarantees savings.</p>
<p>He was appointed in June 1995 and most recapitalisation proceedings, resulting in a decline of money market rates to below 10 from 32 percent, have been completed during his term in office. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
